      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_z6uUuDjniEy5A1Sk",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>No nicotine, no vapor, just natural relief.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_eEqVqOkSnNqv6Lsm",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Imagine a world where you can satisfy cravings without the usual harmful habits. Lio® is more than just flavored air—it’s about reimagining how you handle those urges. With naturally infused air, your cravings become a calming, flavorful moment. No chemicals, no guilt—just pure relief, literally, from thin air—all thanks to Lio®.</p>"
