        "text_dy2OvaPJptRPcKn6": "<h3>PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h3>",
        "text_tamCnNYL3FLPZjyQ": "<h3>Lio is the flavored air diffuser that makes quitting <strong>simple and enjoyable</strong>. Relief cravings and keep your hand-to-mouth habit—<strong>anytime, anywhere—without nicotine, vapor, or smoke.</strong></h3>",
        "text_mtbLn3Rp17TZIAaD": "<h3>SHIPPING &amp; DELIVERY</h3>",
        "text_wzvKtNFCcPQGyqy4": "<h3><strong>Shipping within the UAE takes 1 to 2 business days, and all orders over €39 qualify for free shipping. </strong></h3><h3></h3><h3>For deliveries outside the UAE but within the Middle East, shipping times are 2 to 3 business days. </h3><h3></h3><h3>Your order will be processed within 5 hours and shipped from our fulfillment center in the UAE.</h3>",
        "text_FncRnkyFiXE2cj86": "<h3>ARE THE INGREDIENTS IN THE FLAVOUR CORES NATURAL?</h3>",
        "text_RrwU2iMdRAPgvgp4": "<h3>You bet! Lio is powered by nature—<strong>no nicotine, smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals</strong>, just pure goodness. Each Core is medical-grade &amp; soaked in a special blend of pure <strong>essential oils</strong>, sourced from farms across the globe. Think of it as a breath of fresh air, straight from nature’s finest!</h3>",
        "text_EtxIZskcuGvXZo7l": "<h3>THE SAFEFY AND SCIENCE</h3>",
        "text_EdMmibvQdroIXxuQ": "<h3><strong>Safety first, always</strong>! Every natural plant compound in our products goes through serious third-party testing. These tests (plus a bunch of studies) prove that what you&apos;re inhaling is <strong>safe and effective</strong>. We&apos;re all about research to make sure you get a reliable, natural, non-electric option that keeps you healthy without skimping on safety or results.</h3>",
        "text_HLyxjXkQ4TWsyS8u": "<h3>WHAT&apos;S IN A STARTERPACK?</h3>",
        "text_BbEVRVrGxPWgJ66B": "<h3><strong>LIO® GEN 2 STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Gen 2 – made from stainless steel 1x Lio® Cleaning Kit – to keep your Lio® Gen 2 spotless 1x Lio® Leather Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to monitor your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>LIO® CLASSIC STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Classic – crafted from olive or walnut wood 1x Lio® Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to track your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3>Finally, choose 3, 6, or 9 bags of your favorite flavor Cores. Each bag contains 3 Cores, with each Core lasting 10 days. Three bags give you a full month of refreshing air!</h3>",
        "text_l9AzhKirYq9QGlr8": "<p>WHAT IS LIO®?</p>",
        "text_z6uUuDjniEy5A1Sk": "<h3>No nicotine, no vapor, just natural relief.</h3>",
        "text_eEqVqOkSnNqv6Lsm": "<p>Imagine a world where you can satisfy cravings without the usual harmful habits. Lio® is more than just flavored air—it’s about reimagining how you handle those urges. With naturally infused air, your cravings become a calming, flavorful moment. No chemicals, no guilt—just pure relief, literally, from thin air—all thanks to Lio®.</p>",
        "text_pgBhqZGFxKDVd1c0": "<p>CUSTOMER EXPERIENCES</p>",
        "text_fdeySEYOEh53of0Z": "<h3>Watch real experiences.</h3>",
        "text_BArXYwYk2XIgFdE6": "<p>See what our customers have to say! Watch their real experiences and hear honest feedback in their own words.</p>",
